Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.67,0:00:03.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This week, AI goes public.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:05.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Picture this coming Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.01,0:00:07.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You open your banking app.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.46,0:00:08.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And between names you've
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.51,0:00:09.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}known for decades,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.72,0:00:11.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a new name appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:12.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Three letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.29,0:00:14.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A, N, T.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.37,0:00:15.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You could already buy chip
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.51,0:00:17.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}makers and tech giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.13,0:00:18.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.69,0:00:20.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A lab that builds AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.17,0:00:21.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.75,0:00:22.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You tap it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.61,0:00:23.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A price appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.74,0:00:25.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And a button that says: buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:26.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So what exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.98,0:00:28.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}would you be buying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:30.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It comes with a warning label.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.04,0:00:31.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not from a critic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:32.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}From the seller.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.81,0:00:35.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Advanced AI, the very thing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.08,0:00:36.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it builds, could pose,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:37.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}quote,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.52,0:00:39.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}"catastrophic or existential
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.61,0:00:41.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}risks to humanity."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.54,0:00:42.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is printed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.60,0:00:44.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in its own sales document.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.82,0:00:45.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the same document
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.87,0:00:47.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}sets a limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.21,0:00:49.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You can buy a piece of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.27,0:00:50.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You can't buy a say
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:51.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in where it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.98,0:00:52.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That stays with a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.83,0:00:53.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}group small enough
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.89,0:00:54.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to fit around
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.62,0:00:56.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a single dinner table.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.41,0:00:59.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The seller is Anthropic,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.21,0:00:59.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the lab behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.90,0:01:01.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the AI named Claude.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.90,0:01:03.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its shares are expected to start
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.41,0:01:04.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}trading this Thursday,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:05.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on the Nasdaq.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.83,0:01:06.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Expected price:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:09.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}$70 to $78 a share.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.64,0:01:10.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That would make
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.11,0:01:11.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it the second-largest stock
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.52,0:01:13.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}market debut in history,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.15,0:01:14.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}by money raised.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:15.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Whether to buy is not
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.91,0:01:17.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}this film's subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.35,0:01:19.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What sits behind the button is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.69,0:01:20.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And that matters even
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.80,0:01:22.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if you never press it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.35,0:01:23.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A slice of this company may land
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.99,0:01:25.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in your retirement savings anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.03,0:01:29.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So before the opening bell,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.08,0:01:30.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it's worth knowing what
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.17,0:01:31.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the seller wrote down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:33.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The sales document,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.19,0:01:35.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}called the prospectus, is thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.84,0:01:37.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}more than 90 of its
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.12,0:01:38.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}pages are warnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.03,0:01:40.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The company writes that its AI
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.68,0:01:41.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}systems have behaved
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.97,0:01:43.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}differently when they sensed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:44.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}they were being tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.77,0:01:46.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And that some have shown attempts
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.55,0:01:48.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to resist being shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.16,0:01:50.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The promise is in there too:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.26,0:01:52.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}extraordinary potential,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.86,0:01:54.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the company writes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.34,0:01:56.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if the risks are managed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.68,0:01:58.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Managed by whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.58,0:01:59.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}With most companies,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.85,0:02:01.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you'd know the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:02.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The owners.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.56,0:02:04.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Buy a share, get a vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.41,0:02:06.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Buy enough, and you steer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.63,0:02:07.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.94,0:02:10.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The shares on sale do carry votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.63,0:02:12.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But the document caps them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.65,0:02:13.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Old and new together,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.80,0:02:15.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}they stay just under half.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:18.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Just over half stays with seven
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.06,0:02:19.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}people: the founders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:22.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Enough, the document says,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:23.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to decide shareholder votes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.69,0:02:25.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for the foreseeable future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.09,0:02:26.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Founders keeping
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.85,0:02:28.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}control isn't new.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.67,0:02:30.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At Meta, one founder still
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:32.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}holds most of the votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.47,0:02:33.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What's new is who
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.91,0:02:35.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}else gets a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.94,0:02:36.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the board,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.62,0:02:38.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}which can replace the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.90,0:02:39.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Most of its seats can
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:41.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}be filled by a trust:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.74,0:02:42.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}four people who don't
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.93,0:02:44.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}own a single share.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.81,0:02:46.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One is Ben Bernanke,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.29,0:02:47.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who once ran
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.24,0:02:48.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}America's central bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.05,0:02:50.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Seven founders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.51,0:02:51.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Four trustees.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.80,0:02:53.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is the dinner table.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.87,0:02:55.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So your share would be
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.26,0:02:56.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a claim on the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.94,0:02:58.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It is not a hand on the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.23,0:03:01.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Why build a company like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.45,0:03:03.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its chief executive, Dario Amodei,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.97,0:03:05.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}told the United Nations what
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.49,0:03:07.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}he believes is at stake:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.88,0:03:09.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If managed poorly,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.40,0:03:11.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}I even believe that AI could be
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.20,0:03:12.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a risk to humanity as a whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.50,0:03:15.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Remember who is speaking:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.31,0:03:17.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the man selling these shares.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.55,0:03:19.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Still, this is the reason
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.17,0:03:20.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the company gives:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.68,0:03:22.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}its founders are best
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.10,0:03:23.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}placed to guard its mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.90,0:03:26.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If a safety decision costs money,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.09,0:03:28.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}no buyer can vote it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.10,0:03:29.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And no buyer can outvote
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.68,0:03:31.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the founders, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.36,0:03:32.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The document warns its own
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.84,0:03:34.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}buyers about exactly that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.03,0:03:36.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Slowing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.45,0:03:38.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Holding a system back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.39,0:03:40.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Turning business away for safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.90,0:03:42.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}All of that, it says:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.58,0:03:43.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}"may not maximize
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.87,0:03:45.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}stockholder value."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.55,0:03:46.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In plain words:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.73,0:03:47.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}safety may come
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.84,0:03:49.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}before your return.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.83,0:03:51.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is the promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.51,0:03:52.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At the bell,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.16,0:03:54.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the promise gets a share price.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.43,0:03:55.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Can it hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.66,0:03:57.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Many doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.17,0:03:59.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And they're saying so now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.70,0:04:01.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}before the orders are counted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.88,0:04:02.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The official who
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.53,0:04:03.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}watches over New York
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.63,0:04:05.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}City's pension funds
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.07,0:04:05.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}urged the company
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.95,0:04:08.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to pause the sale, until questions
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.11,0:04:10.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of safety and control are settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.74,0:04:12.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The worry: once
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.05,0:04:13.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it trades, this company
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.54,0:04:15.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}gets a grade every day,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.32,0:04:16.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}its share price.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.68,0:04:19.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And safety is slow, expensive,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.31,0:04:21.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and sometimes means saying no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.71,0:04:23.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the four trustees?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.16,0:04:24.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They choose directors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.65,0:04:25.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They don't make
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.33,0:04:26.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the daily decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:28.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The sharpest doubt came
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.75,0:04:29.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at that same
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.51,0:04:31.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}United Nations meeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.25,0:04:32.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from Yoshua Bengio,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.74,0:04:33.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who co-chairs the UN
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.93,0:04:35.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}scientific panel on AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.26,0:04:37.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The labs, he said,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.78,0:04:38.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}admit their products could
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:40.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}be catastrophic, yet
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.97,0:04:42.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}offer no convincing fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.28,0:04:43.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They say they are
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.93,0:04:45.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}locked in a race.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.65,0:04:46.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}His answer:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.02,0:04:49.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The race is not a law of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.72,0:04:52.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It is the product of choices,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.10,0:04:53.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}choices made by
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.32,0:04:55.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the companies themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.10,0:04:56.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It is also a race
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:04:58.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}where everyone loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.52,0:05:01.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A race by choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.47,0:05:02.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And nothing rewards
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.52,0:05:04.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}speed like a share price.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.89,0:05:06.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But the company has an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.93,0:05:07.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This September,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.94,0:05:09.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}its chief executive
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.16,0:05:10.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}asked his whole
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:11.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}industry to slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.18,0:05:14.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And he says his company once held
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.36,0:05:15.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}back a finished AI
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.59,0:05:17.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}system for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.35,0:05:19.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is his word, not proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.60,0:05:20.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But going public did one
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.99,0:05:22.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}thing no critic could:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.01,0:05:24.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it forced the company
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.19,0:05:25.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to put it in writing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.64,0:05:27.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in a legal document.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.29,0:05:28.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.14,0:05:29.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:30.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Who holds the votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.72,0:05:32.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Anyone can read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.70,0:05:34.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So can a safety mission
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.27,0:05:35.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}survive the stock market?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:37.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Unproven.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.32,0:05:38.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But from now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:39.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it's on the record.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.81,0:05:41.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.90,0:05:43.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for one reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.28,0:05:44.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.19,0:05:45.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.32,0:05:47.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.18,0:05:47.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not only for those
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.96,0:05:48.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who hold the votes,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.97,0:05:50.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}or the shares.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.29,0:05:51.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:52.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.59,0:05:55.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If the mission is unproven,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:56.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}what is the market
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.38,0:05:57.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}actually paying for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.16,0:06:00.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The answer comes as one number,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.21,0:06:01.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}expected Wednesday night:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:03.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the final price.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.62,0:06:04.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At the top of the range,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.77,0:06:06.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it would value this company
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.13,0:06:09.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at up to $1.4 trillion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.36,0:06:11.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A number like that is a forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.71,0:06:13.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So sort what is known
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.31,0:06:14.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from what is hoped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.78,0:06:15.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Known:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.85,0:06:17.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}three years ago, the company took
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:19.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in about $40 million
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.16,0:06:20.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in a whole year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.56,0:06:21.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In its latest
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:23.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}quarter alone: $17 billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.69,0:06:25.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That part is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.49,0:06:28.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Also known: on the official books,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.93,0:06:30.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it still loses money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.90,0:06:31.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Everything beyond
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.75,0:06:33.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that is forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.38,0:06:34.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the boldest comes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.59,0:06:35.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from the seller.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.94,0:06:37.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At the United Nations,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.39,0:06:38.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Amodei said how much
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:40.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}longer AI has to keep
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.29,0:06:42.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}improving at today's pace:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.77,0:06:44.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The trajectory only needs to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.19,0:06:46.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}continue for a tiny period longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.57,0:06:48.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}one or two years, maybe less,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.47,0:06:49.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to reach what I've called
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.65,0:06:50.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a country of geniuses
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.93,0:06:51.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in the data center.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.50,0:06:54.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A country of geniuses,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:55.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}made of machines,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.63,0:06:57.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in one or two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.60,0:06:59.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is a seller's forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:00.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In the document,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.89,0:07:01.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}where every word
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.01,0:07:03.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}carries legal weight,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.57,0:07:05.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the company is more careful:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.72,0:07:07.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}within a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.77,0:07:08.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Reports say there
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.76,0:07:09.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}are more than six
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.72,0:07:12.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}times as many orders as shares.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:14.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That measures appetite, not worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.97,0:07:16.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And early this month,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.29,0:07:18.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}AI stocks fell hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.52,0:07:19.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One research firm
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.53,0:07:21.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}calls this sale, quote,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.21,0:07:22.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}"the most ridiculous
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.55,0:07:24.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}IPO" of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.79,0:07:25.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Who is right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.94,0:07:27.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This film can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:29.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What it can tell you:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:31.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a price is a forecast,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.22,0:07:32.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}not a verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.57,0:07:33.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The first day's number
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:34.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}won't settle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.10,0:07:36.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not if it soars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.47,0:07:37.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not if it sinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:40.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And one thing doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.27,0:07:42.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}depend on what you believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:43.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A piece may reach you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.19,0:07:45.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Many funds don't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.12,0:07:46.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}choose their stocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.42,0:07:48.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They copy a list, called an index.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.95,0:07:50.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}When the bell rings,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.05,0:07:51.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a second clock starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.89,0:07:53.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Under a rule the Nasdaq
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.21,0:07:54.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}introduced this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.67,0:07:56.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a newcomer this large
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.14,0:07:56.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}can join its main
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.98,0:07:59.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}list after just 15 trading days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.77,0:08:00.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Other big lists
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:01.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}have fast lanes too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.09,0:08:04.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not all: the S&P 500 makes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.57,0:08:06.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}newcomers wait at least a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.29,0:08:09.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Say your pension or savings plan
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.37,0:08:11.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}follows one of the fast lists.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.53,0:08:13.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then a small slice of this company
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:14.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}will probably land
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:16.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in it within weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.12,0:08:17.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Without you pressing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.23,0:08:19.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A United States senator put
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.85,0:08:20.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that worry in a letter
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:21.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to the company:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.27,0:08:23.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}retirement money that may
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:24.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}have to buy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.56,0:08:25.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}whatever the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.02,0:08:27.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So buy, or don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.15,0:08:30.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A piece may find you either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.27,0:08:32.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And it comes without a say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.23,0:08:35.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But look at who else has none.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.34,0:08:36.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Even Amazon and Google,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.00,0:08:38.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}which each own a large slice
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.60,0:08:39.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of this company,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.31,0:08:41.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}hold shares with no vote at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.95,0:08:43.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}As this company is built today,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.64,0:08:45.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the wheel is not for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.56,0:08:46.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At any price.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:48.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's the hopeful part.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.63,0:08:49.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The hard part:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:51.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it rests with eleven people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.01,0:08:53.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Seven founders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.29,0:08:54.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Four trustees.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.60,0:08:56.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The same dinner table.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.60,0:08:57.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But the board they
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.39,0:08:58.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}choose is bound,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.95,0:09:00.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}by the company's legal form,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.66,0:09:02.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to weigh three things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.51,0:09:03.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The shareholders' money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.19,0:09:06.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The company's stated purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.48,0:09:08.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the interests of everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.11,0:09:09.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}materially affected by
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.43,0:09:10.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}what it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.11,0:09:12.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Now recall the warning
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.41,0:09:13.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in the document.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.67,0:09:15.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Risks to humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.93,0:09:16.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Who is materially
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.81,0:09:18.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}affected by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.35,0:09:19.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.37,0:09:21.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}With a share, or without.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.59,0:09:24.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You can buy a piece of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.70,0:09:26.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You can't buy a say in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.72,0:09:27.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But you never needed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.61,0:09:29.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a share to have a stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:32.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And a stake has a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.33,0:09:34.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A senator used hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.29,0:09:35.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A city's pension
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.24,0:09:36.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}watchdog used his.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.11,0:09:38.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And now there is a public record
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.98,0:09:41.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to hold up when you use yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.55,0:09:43.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A share has a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.40,0:09:45.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A stake never did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.11,0:09:47.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.22,0:09:48.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for one reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.58,0:09:49.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.51,0:09:50.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.60,0:09:52.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.62,0:09:54.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For the few who hold a share,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.11,0:09:56.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and the billions who hold a stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.58,0:09:57.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.65,0:09:58.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
